      "Pro Suite, Enterprise, Unlimited, and Agentforce 1 Sales list prices are billed annually on the pricing page; only Starter Suite explicitly offers monthly or annual at the same $25 USD list rate.",
      "Not a lightweight SMB CRM — administration, implementation, and configuration overhead are part of the platform tradeoff versus Pipedrive-style tools.",
      "Sales Cloud is Salesforce’s CRM for sales teams — Free Suite for getting started (2 seats), Starter/Pro suites for SMBs, through Enterprise/Unlimited for advanced pipeline, AI, and developer/admin depth. (audience: mid-market sales orgs, enterprise sales teams)"
